name=Max Time In Server
id=MaxTimeInServer
description=Caps how long each account may play per week on a dedicated server. Counts the real minutes a player spends connected over the week and turns away anyone who has spent their weekly budget, telling them how much they used and when it resets. The budget, the day the week resets on, who is exempt from it, and the wording are server sandbox options. Built for Build 42 multiplayer; it does nothing in single-player.
author=Carlos Alandete Sastre
